msgctxt "156"
msgid "Haahh... Haahh... Haahh... You ain't no pitchman, are ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "No, but I would like to pitch an idea. You ready to listen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Fine. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"I'm working for a casino looking for bouncers. They asked me\r\n"
"to bring you there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm a pro boxer. One of my opponents died in the ring,\r\n"
"and then some other stuff happened, and... Well, they forced\r\n"
"me out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Why would you want somebody like me as a bouncer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't it be a shame to let those fists of yours go to\r\n"
"waste?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "I wanna go back to boxing, to get back in the ring..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't mind doin' some bouncer work, but in return,\r\n"
"you gotta find some way to get me back in the game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"I can't help you with that. That's something you have to do\r\n"
"on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "So that's how it is..."
msgstr "Quindi è così che stanno le cose."

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Look, I understand how you feel. Just keep believing in\r\n"
"yourself, and sooner or later you'll get your chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "The important thing is to stay strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"But if you're out of shape when your chance finally comes,\r\n"
"you'll never find your way back into the ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"It might sound like I'm trying to feed you a line, but the\r\n"
"thing you need to do right now is keep fighting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't it be better to do that as a bouncer instead of\r\n"
"causing trouble around town?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"...You know, you're right. Fine. I accept your offer.\r\n"
"So where is this place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"It's in a building on Park Boulevard. I'll give you the number.\r\n"
"You can go there whenever you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"I'll go there as soon as I sober up a little. And... thanks\r\n"
"for the talk. Here, you can have this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Rage Bracelet<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto un <Color:8>Bracciale dell'ira<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "492"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Hey, are you Sendo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"Yeah? Who are you? Some kind of pitchman, or barker, or...\r\n"
"Whaddya call those guys who promote for those clubs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "I know of a place you might like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Oh yeah? Then show me pictures of the girls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"I can't say anything until I see the photos. If you're\r\n"
"really promoting for a club, you oughta have pictures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "I wanted to talk to you. Got a minute to spare?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"Like hell I do... I'm still tryin' to get over this hideous\r\n"
"monstrosity they introduced me to. So leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr "Ehi..."

msgctxt "660"
msgid "I told you I was mad enough already, ya jerkoff!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"You know what I do to people who don't learn the first\r\n"
"time!? I kick their asses!"
msgstr ""

